@startuml UC_OVERVIEW
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #263E35
title BookBridge user goals
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Customer
actor Staff
rectangle "BookBridge local prototype" {
  usecase "UC-03\nBrowse and find books" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04\nCreate a reservation" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05\nCancel an own pending reservation" as UC05
  usecase "UC-07\nView own reservations" as UC07
  usecase "UC-01\nMaintain the book catalogue" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\nRecord stock receipts" as UC02
  usecase "UC-06\nConfirm collection" as UC06
  usecase "UC-08\nView and filter all reservations" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09\nSummarise completed reservations" as UC09
}
Customer -- UC03
Customer -- UC04
Customer -- UC05
Customer -- UC07
UC01 -- Staff
UC02 -- Staff
UC06 -- Staff
UC08 -- Staff
UC09 -- Staff
note bottom of UC07
Selecting cancellation starts UC-05.
Viewing a list does not require cancellation.
end note
note bottom of UC09
Predefined demo identities; sample data.
Payment and collection are outside software.
No registration, cart, delivery or legacy sync.
end note
@enduml
